    "steam_appid": 2388750,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388750/extras/5808ea2b6c80544a0fad422a771eeeee.poster.avif?t=1755077729\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388750/extras/5808ea2b6c80544a0fad422a771eeeee.webm?t=1755077729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388750/extras/5808ea2b6c80544a0fad422a771eeeee.mp4?t=1755077729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARM OF SATAN is a tough precision platformer designed for <i>2-player co-op</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring <strong>kick ass visuals</strong> influenced by the <i>Hellboy</i> comics, <strong>arcade-inspired</strong> gameplay, and a <strong>deep</strong> and <strong>captivating narrative</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be played single-player as a <i>difficult twin-stick</i>, but it is designed to be a <i>truly awesome</i> <strong>co-op experience</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388750/extras/5fbcfb6d07d085b6a669f13073a7518b.poster.avif?t=1755077729\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388750/extras/5fbcfb6d07d085b6a669f13073a7518b.webm?t=1755077729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388750/extras/5fbcfb6d07d085b6a669f13073a7518b.mp4?t=1755077729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Arm of Satan follows the journey of two characters: <strong>Girl &amp; Arm</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Girl </strong>should not be here. <strong>Arm</strong> claims to know a way out\u2026 Together, they descend through the underworlds in search of <i>salvation</i>\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GIRL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388750/extras/f8131c1e929dff0036ced9ebd1d8e3f6.poster.avif?t=1755077729\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388750/extras/f8131c1e929dff0036ced9ebd1d8e3f6.webm?t=1755077729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388750/extras/f8131c1e929dff0036ced9ebd1d8e3f6.mp4?t=1755077729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Girl controls like a classic platformer. She is in charge of movement and jumping.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(great for onboarding newer or younger players).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388750/extras/9c1502cbd2d09267486d9b9b7e575d00.poster.avif?t=1755077729\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388750/extras/9c1502cbd2d09267486d9b9b7e575d00.webm?t=1755077729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388750/extras/9c1502cbd2d09267486d9b9b7e575d00.mp4?t=1755077729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arm is an action-oriented reflex machine: grabbing, punching and throwing everything and anything to protect Girl.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TOGETHER...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388750/extras/acdffb5efb80a23af3ef33e777014e0b.poster.avif?t=1755077729\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388750/extras/acdffb5efb80a23af3ef33e777014e0b.webm?t=1755077729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388750/extras/acdffb5efb80a23af3ef33e777014e0b.mp4?t=1755077729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Girl &amp; Arm must synchronise to platform, traverse, dodge and climb their way through the treacherous depths of the underworlds.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the many underworlds, inspired by diverse cultural depictions of the afterlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388750/extras/0d76fa731efa4742de13104066824ca7.avif?t=1755077729\" /></span><strong>Engage (at your own risk) with the many denizens of the underworlds.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388750/extras/a0968e7fec94eb87091ba6b50d203ed7.poster.avif?t=1755077729\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388750/extras/a0968e7fec94eb87091ba6b50d203ed7.webm?t=1755077729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388750/extras/a0968e7fec94eb87091ba6b50d203ed7.mp4?t=1755077729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Finished the story? Play endlessly in ARCADE MODE, the dedicated speedrunning mode with tonnes of 'Tribulations' that challenge you to set fast times.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388750/extras/45d5c7042c524c3abd1338de75774124.avif?t=1755077729\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your eyes on our community discord for news, insights and details.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388750/extras/5808ea2b6c80544a0fad422a771eeeee.poster.avif?t=1755077729\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388750/extras/5808ea2b6c80544a0fad422a771eeeee.webm?t=1755077729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388750/extras/5808ea2b6c80544a0fad422a771eeeee.mp4?t=1755077729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARM OF SATAN is a tough precision platformer designed for <i>2-player co-op</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring <strong>kick ass visuals</strong> influenced by the <i>Hellboy</i> comics, <strong>arcade-inspired</strong> gameplay, and a <strong>deep</strong> and <strong>captivating narrative</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be played single-player as a <i>difficult twin-stick</i>, but it is designed to be a <i>truly awesome</i> <strong>co-op experience</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388750/extras/5fbcfb6d07d085b6a669f13073a7518b.poster.avif?t=1755077729\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388750/extras/5fbcfb6d07d085b6a669f13073a7518b.webm?t=1755077729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2388750/extras/5fbcfb6d07d085b6a669f13073a7518b.mp4?t=1755077729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Arm of Satan follows the journey of two characters: <strong>Girl &amp; Arm</strong>.</p>